  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b4ae5e38c4837a4e5fad38036d4e9c4f5ec902325054f6f26e269365ad507296.png] \n\nLets check each option:\n\n \n\n1) × and – \n\nAfter interchanging signs, we get:\n\n⇒ 63 × 3 + __**45 ÷ 15**__ - 2 \n\n⇒ __**63 × 3**__ + 3 - 2 \n\n⇒ __**189 + 3**__ - 2 \n\n⇒ __**192 - 2**__\n\n⇒ __**190 ≠ 36**__\n\n \n\n2) – and ÷\n\nAfter interchanging signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __**63 ÷ 3**__ + 45 - 15 × 2 \n\n⇒ 21 + 45 - __**15 × 2**__ \n\n⇒ __**21 + 45**__ - 30\n\n⇒ __**66 - 30**__\n\n⇒ __**36 = 36**__\n\n \n\n3) ÷ and × \n\nAfter interchanging signs, we get:\n\n⇒ 63 – 3 + 45 × __**15 ÷ 2**__\n\n⇒ 63 – 3 + __**45 × 7.5**__\n\n⇒ __**63**__ – 3 + __**337.5**__\n\n⇒ __**400.5 - 3**__\n\n⇒ __**397.5 ≠ 36**__\n\n \n\n4) + and × \n\nAfter interchanging signs, we get:\n\n⇒ 63 – 3 × __**45 ÷ 15**__ + 2\n\n⇒ 63 – __**3 × 3**__ + 2\n\n⇒ __**63**__ – 9 __**+ 2**__\n\n⇒ __**65 – 9**__ \n\n⇒ __**56 ≠ 36**__\n\n \n\nHence,** 'option 2'** is the correct answer.",
